<title>USA: Corecare Systems files for Nasdaq listing.</title>
<headline>Corecare Systems files for Nasdaq listing.</headline>
<dateline>ERDENHEIM, Penn. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>CoreCare Systems Inc said on Thursday it has filed an application to be listed on the Nasdaq Small Cap Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The company also recently submitted its 10-SB to the Securities and Exchange Commission to become a reporting company.</p>
<p>CoreCare, a behavioral health system provider, said these actions will improve the company's visibility in the marketplace.</p>
</text>
